<div class="container docs-shell">
    @include('partials.docs-side')
    <article class="docs-body">
        <h1>Filesystem</h1>
        <p>The local disk writes under <code class="inline">storage/app</code> (configurable in <code class="inline">config/filesystems.json</code>). Paths cannot escape the disk root.</p>

        <pre><code>Storage.put("avatars/ada.txt", "hello")
Storage.get("avatars/ada.txt")
Storage.exists("avatars/ada.txt")
Storage.delete("avatars/ada.txt")

Storage.disk("local").put("notes/one.txt", "ok")</code></pre>
        <p>Only the local driver is implemented. There is no S3 adapter.</p>
    </article>
</div>
